<title>UK: ICO pegs 1996/7 coffee production at 99.7 mln bags.</title>
<headline>ICO pegs 1996/7 coffee production at 99.7 mln bags.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The International Coffee Organization (ICO) on Tuesday issued a document estimating 1996/97 world coffee production at 99.7 million 60-kg bags against 85.6 million in the 1995/96 period, delegates said.</p>
<p>Delegates to the ICO meeting told Reuters the document, however, did not contain ICO 1996/97 consumption nor export estimates.</p>
<p>An ICO official on Tuesday said the ICO, which groups 58 world consumers and producers, could not make the document publicly available.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +4471 542 79 28</p>
